{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TetVolAnalytic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TetVolAnalytic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.LobAnalytic","lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.IdealTetrahedronVolumeConcave"],"declarations":7,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.analyticOnNhd_tetVol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.analyticOnNhd_tetVol","kind":"theorem","line":116,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L116-L119","doc":"**The Λ-sum volume chart is real-analytic on the whole open angle\nsimplex** — the `AnalyticOnNhd` form the identity theorem consumes. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.analyticAt_tetVol","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.analyticAt_tetVol","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L92-L114","doc":"**The Λ-sum volume chart is real-analytic at every interior angle pair.**\nEach summand is `Λ` composed with an analytic coordinate map, and each of the\nthree angles stays inside `(0, π)` where `Λ` is analytic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_third_mem_Ioo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_third_mem_Ioo","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L87-L90","doc":"On the simplex the third angle `π − α − β` lies in `(0, π)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_snd_mem_Ioo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_snd_mem_Ioo","kind":"theorem","line":82,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L82-L85","doc":"On the simplex the second angle lies in `(0, π)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_fst_mem_Ioo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.tetSimplex_fst_mem_Ioo","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L77-L80","doc":"On the simplex the first angle lies in `(0, π)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.isPreconnected_tetSimplex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.isPreconnected_tetSimplex","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L71-L75","doc":"**The open angle simplex is preconnected** — the hypothesis the identity\ntheorem (`AnalyticOnNhd.eqOn_of_preconnected_of_frequently_eq`) consumes.\nImmediate from its proved convexity. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.isOpen_tetSimplex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.isOpen_tetSimplex","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TetVolAnalytic.lean#L59-L69","doc":"**The open angle simplex is open.**  It is the intersection of three\npreimages of open half-lines under continuous coordinate maps. ","signatureChunk":0}]}